             <step n="4" text="FOR each AT; CREATE a namespace entry for the CQU; ADD a join; SET purpose = its OP from step 3; SET ef = its EF from step 3; IDENTIFY the members in that join's refs: SET key = 'path'; SET value = '[relative path]'; CHECK BKN; CHECK MISS; NEXT AT." />
             <step n="5" text="FOR each AUE; FOR each AT; OBSERVE DE as an RE; DECOMPOSE its requirements and dependencies as EF of other elements. The DE simultaneously remains the PE serving the external CQU's OP where that relationship exists. IF an encountered element itself bears an OP; TRACE it as an RE without creating a duplicate namespace record; END IF; CHECK BKN; CHECK MISS; NEXT AT; NEXT AUE." />
